    "name": "AutoParts Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 1477080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477080/extras/e0a46fe701236440b3b34346ab343e29.avif?t=1751852328\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Own it. Command it. Make a profit.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In AutoParts Simulator, you are the owner of an auto parts store and you need to turn it into a successful business. Negotiate with demanding customers, manage an ever-changing inventory, adjust your prices and expand your store intelligently.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Every decision directly influences your profits, reputation and customer loyalty. Will you choose an honest and efficient path? Or maximize profits at any cost?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Key Features:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83e\uddfe Complete store simulation: control inventory, prices, taxes, service and profits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\uded2 Customers with unique personalities: each with their own expectations, budget and negotiation style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83c\udfec Store expansion: buy new shelves, increase space and add new departments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udcc8 Dynamic economy: prices go up and down according to the market and your decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udd27 Realistic parts: Hundreds of automotive parts categorized with different qualities, brands and uses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83c\udfaf Career mode: Face challenges such as economic crises, aggressive competition and difficult customers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Get ready for a challenging and engaging business management experience. Your success depends on strategy, persuasion and a keen eye for opportunities!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477080/extras/e0a46fe701236440b3b34346ab343e29.avif?t=1751852328\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Own it. Command it. Make a profit.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In AutoParts Simulator, you are the owner of an auto parts store and you need to turn it into a successful business. Negotiate with demanding customers, manage an ever-changing inventory, adjust your prices and expand your store intelligently.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Every decision directly influences your profits, reputation and customer loyalty. Will you choose an honest and efficient path? Or maximize profits at any cost?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Key Features:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83e\uddfe Complete store simulation: control inventory, prices, taxes, service and profits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\uded2 Customers with unique personalities: each with their own expectations, budget and negotiation style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83c\udfec Store expansion: buy new shelves, increase space and add new departments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udcc8 Dynamic economy: prices go up and down according to the market and your decisions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udd27 Realistic parts: Hundreds of automotive parts categorized with different qualities, brands and uses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83c\udfaf Career mode: Face challenges such as economic crises, aggressive competition and difficult customers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Get ready for a challenging and engaging business management experience. Your success depends on strategy, persuasion and a keen eye for opportunities!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p>",
